[SZoneTips2187]
sMessage_ATT[0]="Here is one of the three consoles to hack into to reach the mission objective and win the game. End of presentation."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]="Here is one of the three consoles to hack into to reach the mission objective and win the game. End of presentation."
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips2190]
sMessage_ATT[0]="For this mission, you will have to infiltrate two zones in succession."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]="For this mission, you will have to infiltrate two zones in succession."
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips2193]
sMessage_ATT[0]="You can use this switch to clear a direct passage from your point of departure."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]="You can use this switch to clear a direct passage from your point of departure."
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips2198]
sMessage_ATT[0]="You are entering a zone that can be swept with defender firepower. They cannot access this zone, but their grenades can! However, there are many paths you can use to cross it."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]="You are entering a zone that can be swept with defender firepower. They cannot access this zone, but their grenades can! However, there are many paths you can use to cross it."
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips2201]
sMessage_ATT[0]="Note the  pipes running over the walls here and there. They can help you pass from one alley to another, complicating the defenders' attempts to keep track of you."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]="Note the  pipes running under the walls here and there. They can help you pass from one alley to another, complicating the defenders' attempts to keep track of you."
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips2210]
sMessage_ATT[0]="You are arriving in front of the building that houses the zone 1 mission objectives. You can choose between placing a bomb or hacking into a terminal."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]="You are arriving in front of the building that houses the zone 1 mission objectives. You can choose between placing a bomb or hacking into a terminal."
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips2213]
sMessage_ATT[0]="This is one of the two objectives in zone 1. Destroying the jacks enables you to access zone 2 and change the topology. Do not place a bomb, and continue the visit."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]="This is one of the two objectives in zone 1. Destroying the jacks enables you to access zone 2 and change the topology. Do not place a bomb, and continue the visit."
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips2216]
sMessage_ATT[0]="Press the button and go to the first floor."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]="Press the button and go to the first floor."
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips2219]
sMessage_ATT[0]="To access the offices that hold the second zone 1 mission objective, you can hack into this panel, but the defenders will be alerted. Other, more discreet, paths are available."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]="To access the offices that hold the second zone 1 mission objective, you can hack into this panel, but the defenders will be alerted. Other, more discreet, paths are available."
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips2222]
sMessage_ATT[0]="This is one of the two consoles to hack into in order to reach the zone 1 mission objective. Take the objective to continue the visit."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]="This is one of the two consoles to hack into in order to reach the zone 1 mission objective. Take the objective to continue the visit."
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

[SZoneTips2225]
sMessage_ATT[0]="You are now in zone 2. Your mission objective is to hack into one of the three terminals located there,or take hdd."
sMessage_ATT[1]=""
sMessage_DEF[0]="You are now in zone 2. Your mission objective is to hack into one of the three terminals located there, or take hdd."
sMessage_DEF[1]=""

